WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.868
Ringo and Gaston put parts together.

2
00:00:05.869 --> 00:00:09.782
Soon they were done.

3
00:00:09.783 --> 00:00:16.378
"I hope this works," Ringo said.

4
00:00:16.379 --> 00:00:20.261
Then Gaston got a bike.

5
00:00:20.262 --> 00:00:22.917
"You can use this one."

6
00:00:22.918 --> 00:00:38.592
"Thanks!" Ringo took off with Bot.

7
00:00:38.593 --> 00:00:43.513
Zoom!

8
00:00:43.514 --> 00:00:46.649
"There's the track," Bot said.

9
00:00:46.650 --> 00:00:50.185
Racers waited at the starting line.

10
00:00:50.186 --> 00:00:54.515
"Hmm," Ringo said.

11
00:00:54.516 --> 00:00:58.764
"I don't see any red Astro bikes."

12
00:00:58.765 --> 00:01:02.254
Suddenly a laser fired. Zap!

13
00:01:02.255 --> 00:01:06.387
The race started!

14
00:01:06.388 --> 00:01:20.170
"Hang on, Bot!" Ringo cried.

15
00:01:20.171 --> 00:01:44.430
The track twisted and turned.

16
00:01:44.431 --> 00:01:46.459
Bot looked down.

17
00:01:46.460 --> 00:01:51.168
"I see drops of green paint!" she said.

18
00:01:51.169 --> 00:01:54.575
Ringo looked ahead.

19
00:01:54.576 --> 00:01:58.205
Green paint dripped from one bike.

20
00:01:58.206 --> 00:02:01.784
The bike was really red!

21
00:02:01.785 --> 00:02:07.625
Ringo gasped. "The missing Astro bike!"

22
00:02:07.626 --> 00:02:11.188
The bike shot ahead.

23
00:02:11.189 --> 00:02:14.396
"Now I can't see it!" Ringo said.

24
00:02:14.397 --> 00:02:17.208
"Hold on!" Bot said.

25
00:02:17.209 --> 00:02:19.690
Crick, crick, crick!

26
00:02:19.691 --> 00:02:22.377
Bot's neck stretched up.

27
00:02:22.378 --> 00:02:25.197
"I see the green bike!" Bot said.

28
00:02:25.198 --> 00:02:32.574
"Go, Ringo!"

29
00:02:32.575 --> 00:02:35.263
Ringo zoomed around racers.

30
00:02:35.264 --> 00:02:42.938
Soon he was right behind the green bike.

31
00:02:42.939 --> 00:02:45.599
The track made a sharp turn.

32
00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:48.166
The green bike went too fast.

33
00:02:48.167 --> 00:02:51.476
It flew off the track!

34
00:02:51.477 --> 00:02:56.716
The thief shouted. "Ahh!"

